# Copy to functions/.env and edit only if a deploy fails for one of these reasons.
# firebase-functions reads this file automatically at deploy time.

# ── Marz Pay egress ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# TradeBot reuses Investio's VPC connector so Marz Pay sees the same
# allowlisted IP. If the connector does not exist in this project the DEPLOY
# fails with "connector not found". Uncomment the line below (leave it empty)
# to deploy without it — payments still work, but your egress IP will not be
# stable, so Marz Pay may reject the calls if they allowlist by IP.
# MARZPAY_VPC_CONNECTOR=

# ── Webhook URL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only set this if your functions are not in us-central1. It must match the
# real deployed URL of tbMarzPayWebhook, or Marz Pay callbacks go nowhere and
# subscriptions never activate.
# TRADEBOT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://<region>-investio-ug.cloudfunctions.net/tbMarzPayWebhook
